	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r0901_trainerm_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さまざまな　こうげき♪
さまざまな　ポケモンたち♪▼
なんだか　たのしいな！　きみ
また　あしたも　あそびに　おいでよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T07:56:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T07:56:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さまざまな　攻撃♪
さまざまな　ポケモンたち♪▼
なんだか　楽しいな！　きみ
また　明日も　遊びに　おいでよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T07:56:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T07:56:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：White2ver
・アイテム入手後
　日付が変わるまで繰り返し</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T06:21:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERM</Text>
